			Welcome to the Town of Warren, Rhode island
			The smallest town in the smallest county in the smallest state
			Welcome to the Town of Warren, Rhode Island
Nestled along the East Bay, Warren is a vibrant waterfront community rich in history, culture, and small-town charm. From our historic downtown and thriving arts scene to our beautiful shoreline and welcoming neighborhoods, Warren offers a unique blend of New England tradition and modern community life.
Our website is the gateway to town services, community news, and upcoming events. Whether you are a lifelong resident, a new neighbor, or a visitor discovering Warren for the first time, we invite you to explore all that our town has to offer.
Thank you for being part of our community—we’re glad you’re here.





